AvatarFallback.description:
Shown until (or unless) the image loads: initials or an icon. Text renders at 0.4em of the avatar; an svg fills it.

  AvatarFallback { "SJ" }
  AvatarFallback(delay: 600) { "SJ" }   # wait before showing, avoids a flash on fast loads

examples.notes:
AvatarFallback shows until the image has loaded, so a pulsing placeholder inside it
is swapped for the photo automatically. This image is served with a 2.5s delay;
use Lookbook's refresh button to watch it again.

